You are an independent adjudicator for a code-review evaluation. The checkout in your working directory is at the
HEAD of a pull request at the moment it was reviewed. Base commit: fde71153503a2a963fd4435d61b814972d6d991b. Head commit: db2f68639c4f7cacaf43f6809564b419a6b5e5c9 (current HEAD).
Inspect the change with `git diff fde71153503a2a963fd4435d61b814972d6d991b..db2f68639c4f7cacaf43f6809564b419a6b5e5c9` and by reading code at head and at base (`git show fde71153503a2a963fd4435d61b814972d6d991b:<path>`).
